    {
      "id": "u_0d2c0f1a4309bf0de4369115_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Upon startup, Trilium will automatically migrate the __TRILIUM_PH_0__database__TRILIUM_PH_1__ to the new version. Note that after migration, older versions of Trilium will be unable to read the database. If you need to revert to a previous version of Trilium and its database, you can restore the __TRILIUM_PH_2__backup__TRILIUM_PH_3__ that is created prior to migration.",
      "sourceHash": "0d2c0f1a4309bf0de43691154717a26514a0cdf975d66d6745cc39529575f543",
      "context": "Upgrading TriliumNext > Database Compatibility and Migration",
      "contextHash": "578d89c7de5070dd34ed70d900a4ce8e1ac44fac7b1a351d07f719cce8d624c9",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "起動時に、Triliumは自動的に__TRILIUM_PH_0__データベース__TRILIUM_PH_1__を新しいバージョンに移行します。移行後は、古いバージョンのTriliumでデータベースを読み取れなくなることに注意してください。Triliumとそのデータベースを以前のバージョンに戻す必要がある場合は、移行前に作成された__TRILIUM_PH_2__バックアップ__TRILIUM_PH_3__を復元できます。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
